# 中屏 (an opened fold upright), a finger: two chats chosen in turn from the sidebar, then nothing
# touched for 10 s, the sidebar's chats at work turning: what is drawn while nothing moves but them.
system {"size_class":{"width":"medium","height":"medium"}}
timeout 20000
until 新建对话
wait 500
tap 夜里的构建又失败了
wait 1000
tap 首页的列表改成按天分组
wait 1000
log measure
wait 10000
exit
